Renoir's A642 is Gen6, not the donor's A830/Gen8. Keep its chip-id
match ahead of FD660's wildcard, its LPDDR4X bank swizzle and register
values, expressed in Mesa26's split magic/raw register schema.
This is the only board patch applied after the verified consolidated patch;
none of the historical Mesa25 patches belong on the Mesa26 source tree.

--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
